    "正在清除插件数据、偏好设置、扩展数据和凭据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clearing plugin data, preferences, extension data, and credentials."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在清除插件数据、偏好设置、扩展数据和凭据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在清除外掛資料、偏好設定、擴充資料和憑證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此操作会永久删除 Wakey 自己保存的数据。用户自己的数据、偏好和文件不会被删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will permanently delete data saved by Wakey. Your own data, preferences, and files will not be deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作会永久删除 Wakey 自己保存的数据。用户自己的数据、偏好和文件不会被删除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作會永久刪除 Wakey 自己儲存的資料。用戶自己的資料、偏好和檔案不會被刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此操作无法撤销": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This action cannot be undone"
